``` --- ## PostHog Package: `@flags-sdk/posthog` ```bash
pnpm i @flags-sdk/posthog
``` Env vars, always required:
- `POSTHOG_HOST` (e.g. `https://us.i.posthog.com` or `https://eu.i.posthog.com`)
- `POSTHOG_PROJECT_API_KEY` (`phc_...`) Optional, opts into local evaluation (background polling) instead of remote:
- `POSTHOG_SECRET_KEY` (`phs_...`) For the Flags Explorer (`getProviderData` only):
