``` `identify` must return `{ distinctId }`. ### Flags Explorer Requires: `POSTHOG_PERSONAL_API_KEY`, `POSTHOG_PROJECT_ID` ```ts
import { getProviderData as getPostHogProviderData } from '@flags-sdk/posthog'; export const GET = createFlagsDiscoveryEndpoint( => getPostHogProviderData({ personalApiKey: process.env.POSTHOG_PERSONAL_API_KEY!, projectId: process.env.POSTHOG_PROJECT_ID!, }),
);
``` --- ## GrowthBook Package: `@flags-sdk/growthbook` ```bash
pnpm i @flags-sdk/growthbook
