``` --- ## OpenFeature Package: `@flags-sdk/openfeature` + `@openfeature/server-sdk` ```bash
pnpm i @flags-sdk/openfeature @openfeature/server-sdk
``` ### Setup ```ts
import { createOpenFeatureAdapter } from '@flags-sdk/openfeature'; // Sync provider
OpenFeature.setProvider(new YourProvider);
const adapter = createOpenFeatureAdapter(OpenFeature.getClient); // Async provider
const adapter = createOpenFeatureAdapter(async => { await OpenFeature.setProviderAndWait(new YourProvider); return OpenFeature.getClient;
});
``` ### Methods ```ts
adapter.booleanValue // boolean flags
adapter.stringValue // string flags
adapter.numberValue // number flags
adapter.objectValue // object flags
``` All require `defaultValue` on the flag declaration. --- ## Split Package: `@flags-sdk/split` (Flags Explorer only, adapter coming soon) ```ts
import { getProviderData as getSplitProviderData } from '@flags-sdk/split'; getSplitProviderData({ adminApiKey: process.env.SPLIT_ADMIN_API_KEY, environmentId: process.env.SPLIT_ENVIRONMENT_ID, organizationId: process.env.SPLIT_ORG_ID, workspaceId: process.env.SPLIT_WORKSPACE_ID,
