YouSignOut == /\ \/ (session = "Signed in" /\ session' = "Signed out") /\ UNCHANGED <<wrongTries>> \* 15 minutes pass
S15MinutesPass == /\ \/ (wrongTries = "Locked out" /\ wrongTries' = "No wrong tries") /\ UNCHANGED <<session>> Next == YouSubmitAPassword \/ ThePasswordIsRight \/ ThePasswordIsWrong \/ YouSignOut \/ S15MinutesPass Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars \* A locked-out account never signs in until the lockout ends.
