vars == <<playback, volume>> \* Region Playback
playbackStates == {"Buffering", "Paused", "Playing", "Stopped"}
\* Region Volume
volumeStates == {"Loud", "Muted", "Normal volume"} TypeOK == /\ playback \in playbackStates /\ volume \in volumeStates Init == /\ playback = "Stopped" /\ volume = "Normal volume" \* you press play
YouPressPlay == /\ \/ (playback = "Stopped" /\ playback' = "Buffering") \/ (playback = "Paused" /\ playback' = "Playing") /\ UNCHANGED <<volume>> \* enough data arrives
EnoughDataArrives == /\ \/ (playback = "Buffering" /\ playback' = "Playing") /\ UNCHANGED <<volume>> \* the network slows
TheNetworkSlows == /\ \/ (playback = "Playing" /\ playback' = "Buffering") /\ UNCHANGED <<volume>> \* you press pause
YouPressPause == /\ \/ (playback = "Playing" /\ playback' = "Paused") /\ UNCHANGED <<volume>> \* a call comes in
ACallComesIn == /\ (playback \in {"Playing"} \/ volume \in {"Normal volume", "Loud"}) /\ \/ (playback = "Playing" /\ playback' = "Paused") \/ (playback \notin {"Playing"} /\ UNCHANGED playback) /\ \/ (volume = "Normal volume" /\ volume' = "Muted") \/ (volume = "Loud" /\ volume' = "Muted") \/ (volume \notin {"Normal volume", "Loud"} /\ UNCHANGED volume) \* the track ends
TheTrackEnds == /\ (playback \in {"Playing"} \/ volume \in {"Loud"}) /\ \/ (playback = "Playing" /\ playback' = "Stopped") \/ (playback \notin {"Playing"} /\ UNCHANGED playback) /\ \/ (volume = "Loud" /\ volume' = "Normal volume") \/ (volume \notin {"Loud"} /\ UNCHANGED volume) \* you press stop
YouPressStop == /\ (playback \in {"Playing", "Paused", "Buffering"} \/ volume \in {"Loud"}) /\ \/ (playback = "Playing" /\ playback' = "Stopped") \/ (playback = "Paused" /\ playback' = "Stopped") \/ (playback = "Buffering" /\ playback' = "Stopped") \/ (playback \notin {"Playing", "Paused", "Buffering"} /\ UNCHANGED playback) /\ \/ (volume = "Loud" /\ volume' = "Normal volume") \/ (volume \notin {"Loud"} /\ UNCHANGED volume) \* you turn it up
YouTurnItUp == /\ \/ (volume = "Normal volume" /\ ~(playback = "Stopped") /\ volume' = "Loud") /\ UNCHANGED <<playback>> \* you turn it down
YouTurnItDown == /\ \/ (volume = "Loud" /\ volume' = "Normal volume") /\ UNCHANGED <<playback>> \* you press mute
YouPressMute == /\ \/ (volume = "Normal volume" /\ volume' = "Muted") \/ (volume = "Loud" /\ volume' = "Muted") \/ (volume = "Muted" /\ volume' = "Normal volume") /\ UNCHANGED <<playback>> \* the call ends
TheCallEnds == /\ \/ (volume = "Muted" /\ volume' = "Normal volume") /\ UNCHANGED <<playback>> Next == YouPressPlay \/ EnoughDataArrives \/ TheNetworkSlows \/ YouPressPause \/ ACallComesIn \/ TheTrackEnds \/ YouPressStop \/ YouTurnItUp \/ YouTurnItDown \/ YouPressMute \/ TheCallEnds Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars \* When nothing plays, the volume is never above the safe level.
LoudWhenStopped == ~(playback = "Stopped" /\ volume = "Loud") ==== --- file: scripts/test/corpus/MediaPlayerFixed/chart.mmd ---
