<html>
<head> <title>Feature Extraction with Progress</title> <style> .file-progress { margin: 10px 0; } .file-name { font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 5px; } .progress-bar { width: 100%; height: 20px; background: #f0f0f0; border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; } .progress-fill { height: 100%; background: #4CAF50; transition: width 0.3s; } </style>
